title: Soul Ballad in Twelve
key: Db
tempo: 58
meter: 12/8
style: neosoul

// The soul ballad in twelve-eight: four slow pulses to the bar, three eighths
// in each. Sixteen bars, a verse and a chorus. The verse goes down to the six
// and round a two-five, leaves the one for the four made a dominant, and comes
// back through the three, the six and the two to a suspended five. The chorus
// opens on the four, steps down through the three and the two to the one,
// borrows the minor four, and turns round through the five of two.
[Verse]
| Dbmaj9 | Bbm9 | Ebm9 Ab13 | Dbmaj9 Gb13  |
| Fm7    | Bbm9 | Ebm9      | Ab7sus4 Ab13 |

[Chorus]
| Gbmaj9 | Fm9  | Ebm9      | Dbmaj9    |
| Gbmaj9 | Gbm9 | Fm7 Bb7b9 | Ebm9 Ab13 |
